00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Team [TEAM NAME], Brazil.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Five days before the Uruguay River reached flood stage at Uruguaiana, NASA satellite rain upstream was already extreme.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,500
It pointed to the river corridor, home to about 20,900 people; NISAR then mapped the flooding through cloud.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:25,000
The river still floods; we help prevent the disaster: when, where, who.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Rain warns. Radar sees through.
